: "985603817820578", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824700_985603821153911_3177370747131222055_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JlY4MVfClgEQ7kNvwHiWMDn&_nc_oc=Adq__dwPTLetGkReJlIdboB4KjFTSW_rocUTvBca5ar2KPnRMIBQt551jCZICqcQKoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaxyHQUzHEryfTz90yfcCrOkknrphmPHdkM07GaihfGg&oe=6AEF51E6"}, {"file_name": "RunLine_Indoor1 (6).png", "id": "1708965900383120", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_1708965903716453_4377477545960998519_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nFDKq3jBPsIQ7kNvwGd1Snh&_nc_oc=AdqszPuyT2_iKPnjSsca_bbefzfP1u0Duf1K0jPpGmUGrGCMzno-UIptqu5mX5Kaqis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT2prGBxZkL0bGsQIuAIBOYa_85HqFSNPiEMaQgS2Rg7w&oe=6AEF4BB4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RunLine", "keywords": ["Agility", "Dogsport", "SmarterAgility", "Hoopers", "Trainer"], "long_description": "RunLine. Train smarter, run faster.\n\nRunLine turns your Meta Quest into a portable agility course visualization and training tool. Step inside a course and experience the complete layout at a true 1:1 scale before setting up a single obstacle.\n\nVisualize courses created in SmarterAgility directly in mixed reality. RunLine recreates the full layout based on the original course design, allowing you to explore it exactly as planned.\n\nEvery standard obstacle is represented with precise geometry:\n\n* Jumps, spread hurdles, walls, and tyres\n* 12-pole  and 6-pole weave slaloms\n* Tunnels from 3 to 6 metres\n* A-frames, dog walks, and seesaws\n* Long jumps with 2, 3, or 4 elements\n\nUse hand tracking to move and rotate the entire course until it matches your real training field. Once aligned, the layout stays locked to your space, even when you take off the headset.\n\nWalk your handling lines, rehearse turns, plan cues, and identify tight transitions before running the course with your dog. Spot challenging sections early, refine your approach, and enter the ring with a plan you have already practised.\n\nJudges can preview and refine their course layouts, trainers can prepare sessions and coach their students, and handlers can practise their strategy before a training run or trial.\n\nBuilt for judges, trainers, and handlers.\n\nRequires Meta Quest 3 or Quest 3S. Works standalone, with no PC required.\n", "short_description": "RunLine. Train smarter, run faster.\n\nBring your agility courses to life in mixed reality. Visualize courses created in SmarterAgility at full scale in your own training space using Meta Quest.\n\nSee jumps, weaves, tunnels, A-frames, and more at a true 1:1 scale. Use hand tracking to move and rotate the entire course until it matches your real field. Plan your handling, rehearse your path, and prepare for every run before entering the ring.\n\nBuilt for judges, trainers, and handlers."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1043943788219409", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RunLine", "keywords": ["Agility", "Hoopers", "Handler", "SmarterAgility", "Hundesport"], "long_description": "RunLine. Trainiere smarter, laufe schneller.\n\nRunLine macht deine Meta Quest zu einem mobilen Tool f\u00fcr Parcoursvisualisierung und Agility-Training. Betritt einen Parcours und erlebe das vollst\u00e4ndige Layout im Ma\u00dfstab 1:1, noch bevor du ein einziges Hindernis aufgebaut hast.\n\nStelle Parcours aus SmarterAgility direkt in Mixed Reality dar. RunLine bildet das vollst\u00e4ndige Layout auf Basis des urspr\u00fcnglichen Parcoursdesigns ab, sodass du es genau so erkunden kannst, wie es geplant wurde.\n\nDargestellt werden alle g\u00e4ngigen Hindernisse, darunter H\u00fcrden, Oxer, Mauern, Reifen, 12-Stangen-Slalom, Tunnel von 3 bis 6 Metern, A-W\u00e4nde, Laufstege, Wippen und Weitspr\u00fcnge.\n\nVerschiebe und drehe den gesamten Parcours per Handtracking, bis er zu deinem realen Trainingsfeld passt. Nach der Ausrichtung bleibt das Layout fest im Raum verankert, auch wenn du das Headset absetzt.\n\nGehe deine Laufwege ab, \u00fcbe Wendungen, plane deine Signale und erkenne schwierige \u00dcberg\u00e4nge fr\u00fchzeitig. Richter k\u00f6nnen Parcours vorab pr\u00fcfen, Trainer ihre Einheiten vorbereiten und Hundef\u00fchrer ihre Strategie f\u00fcr Training und Turnier planen.\n\nEntwickelt f\u00fcr Richter, Trainer und Hundef\u00fchrer.\n\nErfordert Meta Quest 3 oder Quest 3S. Funktioniert eigenst\u00e4ndig, ohne PC.", "short_description": "RunLine. Trainiere smarter, laufe schneller.\n\nErwecke deine Agility-Parcours in Mixed Reality zum Leben. Stelle Parcours aus SmarterAgility auf deiner Meta Quest in deinem eigenen Trainingsbereich im Ma\u00dfstab 1:1 dar.\n\nVerschiebe und drehe den gesamten Parcours per Handtracking, bis er zu deinem realen Feld passt. Plane deine Laufwege, \u00fcbe deine Linie und bereite dich auf Training und Turnier vor.\n\nEntwickelt f\u00fcr Richter, Trainer und Hundef\u00fchrer.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://getrunline.app/en/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://getrunline.app/en/tos.html", "publisher_name": "RunLine", "support_website_url": "https://getrunline.app/en/faq.html", "website_url": "https://getrunline.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "s